      "accessed": "2026-11-26",
      "note": "HI1101 left side on approach, 2024-06-10: fitted to the measured 737 MAX 8 shape (nose, tail, fin tip, both doors; within 4 px, camera 9° below); the ribbon's bands traced as centerlines and widths, the title, the flag and registration. The image carries a 'ca350' mark unlike the uploader's name, so its CC0 dedication is the uploader's word; measured only, as any photo is."
    },
